[Portable voice habits]
These habits were counted from the writer's own Korean posts; apply them to this English post.
- Sentence-final marks: exclamation marks 32%, question marks 5%, tildes 10%, ellipses 3%, periods 40%, none 10%; 8% of sentences double a mark.
- Emoji: 12 per 100 sentences.
- Paragraphs: 1–3 sentences each (2 on average); every sentence on its own line.
- Headings and lists: 70% of headings start with an emoji and 40% are questions; lists use '-'.
